 "title": "The Archive Keeper",
 "subtitle": "For a research lead whose results must still be readable next year.",
 "systems": [],
 "technologies": [],
 "stats": [],
 "lede": "Every large run leaves data behind, and the agent looks after it. It checks a finished run against the original request and reports whether every item is present. Stored files are re-checked for damage. When a new version of the data is built, the agent switches readers to it and keeps the previous one until the new one has been confirmed. If storage fails, it reports what was affected and what was recovered.",
